OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad called after ordnance
OL,4,Adonated for exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bomb disposal team has been sent to
OL,7,FLerwick Town Hall in Shetland after
OL,8,Fsomeone donated a "possible ordnance
OL,9,Fdevice" to an upcoming exhibition.
OL,11,FRoads in the area have been cordoned
OL,12,Foff after the item was discovered at
OL,13,Fthe rear of the building at about 18:00
OL,14,Fon Friday evening.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for Shetland Islands
OL,17,FCouncil said the local authority
OL,18,Freceived a donation of WW1 items for a
OL,19,Fdisplay which is due to take place,
OL,20,Fadding: "Among them was a possible
OL,21,Fordnance device, so the police were
OL,22,Finformed."
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
